#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:231
msgid "<a href=\"https://thrive.zohopublic.com/aref/G4734hGpxD/mBWuIqNh8\" target=\"_blank\" >Trust Swiftly</a> is a paid, external service that uses AI to verify the identity and payment of a customer. By using <a href=\"https://thrive.zohopublic.com/aref/G4734hGpxD/mBWuIqNh8\" target=\"_blank\" >Trust Swiftly</a> you can decrease fraud by automatically verifying their information and later use the data to win any dispute cases. To sign up for Trust Swiftly, click this link: <a href=\"https://thrive.zohopublic.com/aref/G4734hGpxD/mBWuIqNh8\" target=\"_blank\">trustswiftly.com</a><hr/>"
msgstr "<a href=\"https://thrive.zohopublic.com/aref/g4734hgpxd/mbwuiqnh8\" target=\"_blank\"> Trust γρήγορα </a> πελάτης. Χρησιμοποιώντας <a href=\"https://thrive.zohopublic.com/aref/g4734hgpxd/mbwuiqnh8\" target=\"_blank\"> Trust γρήγορα Κερδίστε τυχόν περιπτώσεις διαφωνίας. Για να εγγραφείτε γρήγορα στο Trust, κάντε κλικ σε αυτόν τον σύνδεσμο: <a href=\"https://thrive.zohopublic.com/aref/g4734hgpxd/mbwuiqnh8\" target=\"_blank\"> trustswaftly.com </a> <hr/>"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:236
